---
layout: base.njk
---
<article class="reading">
  <p class="crumb"><a href="/finance/">← 勇博開講</a></p>
  {% if draft %}<p class="draft-banner">這是草稿，只有你在本機預覽看得到。確認沒問題後，刪掉檔案裡的 <code>draft: true</code> 就會發布。</p>{% endif %}
  <header class="reading-head">
    <p class="kind">勇博開講・{{ format or ("影片" if youtube else "筆記") }}・<time datetime="{{ page.date | isoDate }}">{{ page.date | ymd }}</time></p>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if summary %}<p class="lead">{{ summary }}</p>{% endif %}
  </header>
  {% if youtube %}
  {# 點了才載入 YouTube 播放器：沒按播放的訪客不用下載約 1MB 的播放器程式 #}
  <div class="video{% if vertical %} vertical{% endif %}"><button type="button" class="yt-facade" data-src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/{{ youtube }}?autoplay=1" data-title="{{ title }}" aria-label="播放影片：{{ title }}"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/{{ youtube }}/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="yt-play" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div>
  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll(".yt-facade").forEach((b) => b.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const f = document.createElement("iframe");
      f.src = b.dataset.src; f.title = b.dataset.title; f.allowFullscreen = true;
      f.allow = "accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; fullscreen";
      f.referrerPolicy = "strict-origin-when-cross-origin";
      b.replaceWith(f);
    }, { once: true }));
  </script>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="prose">{{ content | safe }}</div>
  {% include "ad.njk" %}
  <p class="note-disclaimer">本內容僅供學習與資訊整理，不構成任何投資建議，也不推薦買賣特定標的。投資有風險，請自行判斷並以官方資料為準。</p>
</article>
